        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"310045\">Eric Wieser</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/API.20for.20Fin.2Eprod/near/599180880\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>FWIW, I think the existing uses in mathlib are spelt with <code>List.ofFn f |&gt;.prod</code>, which presumably has more API</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This is very interesting since it would explain this surprising gap.</p>",
