        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"308899\">Yakov Pechersky</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/217875-Is-there-code-for-X.3F/topic/API.20for.20Fin.2Eprod/near/599185376\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Looks more like missing API for decodeProd</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>What do you have in mind?</p>",
